{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a fully serverless REST API using Function Compute behind an API Gateway, scaling to zero for spiky traffic."}
{"t":"req","text":"Pay only for what you use"}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","httpdns","cloud-native-api-gateway","fc","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Mobile App","group":"internet","why":"Native app calling the backend over the internet."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"httpdns","label":"HTTPDNS","group":null,"why":"Prevents DNS hijacking for mobile clients."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"API VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"Cloud-native API Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Routes REST requests with auth and throttling."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-gateway","from":"app","to":"gateway","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"fc","label":"Function Compute","group":"vpc","why":"Runs serverless functions, scales to zero on spikes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-api","from":"gateway","to":"api","label":"invoke"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Simple Log Service","group":"sg","why":"Collects logs and traces from functions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless REST API with HTTPDNS, Cloud-native API Gateway, Function Compute and SLS, paying only per request."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll build a data platform that replicates MySQL in real time via DTS, runs nightly batch with MaxCompute, and serves dashboards."}
{"t":"plan","products":["rds","dts","hologres","maxcompute","dataworks","quick-bi","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Data Platform VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"orders-db","product":"rds","label":"Orders MySQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Primary transactional order database."}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS Sync","group":"vpc","why":"Streams CDC changes to the warehouse in real time."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-orders-db-dts","from":"orders-db","to":"dts","label":"CDC"}
{"t":"node","id":"warehouse","product":"hologres","label":"Hologres Warehouse","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Real-time analytical store for interactive queries."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-warehouse","from":"dts","to":"warehouse","label":"sync"}
{"t":"node","id":"batch","product":"maxcompute","label":"MaxCompute","group":"sg","why":"Runs nightly batch analytics over historical data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-warehouse-batch","from":"warehouse","to":"batch","label":"nightly ETL","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"scheduler","product":"dataworks","label":"DataWorks","group":"sg","why":"Orchestrates nightly jobs and data integration pipelines."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-scheduler-batch","from":"scheduler","to":"batch","label":"schedule","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"dashboards","product":"quick-bi","label":"Quick BI","group":"sg","why":"Business dashboards querying Hologres directly."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-warehouse-dashboards","from":"warehouse","to":"dashboards","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS Logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logging for pipeline monitoring and alerts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-batch-logs","from":"batch","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Real-time MySQL replication via DTS into Hologres, nightly MaxCompute batch orchestrated by DataWorks, and Quick BI dashboards."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a real-time IoT telemetry pipeline: devices connect via MQTT, Flink detects anomalies, and DataV powers the live dashboard."}
{"t":"plan","products":["iot-devices","mqtt","iot-platform","kafka","flink","tair","lindorm","datav","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"field","kind":"external","label":"Field","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"devices","product":"iot-devices","label":"100K IoT devices","group":"field","why":"Sensors sending telemetry every few seconds."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"IoT VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"mqtt-broker","product":"mqtt","label":"MQTT broker","group":"vpc","why":"Ingests high-frequency telemetry from 100K devices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-devices-mqtt","from":"devices","to":"mqtt-broker","label":"MQTT"}
{"t":"node","id":"kafka","product":"kafka","label":"Telemetry Kafka","group":"vpc","why":"Buffers massive device streams for Flink consumption."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-mqtt-kafka","from":"mqtt-broker","to":"kafka","label":"forward","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"flink","product":"flink","label":"Flink stream processor","group":"vpc","why":"Runs real-time anomaly detection over telemetry windows."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-kafka-flink","from":"kafka","to":"flink","label":"stream"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Live state cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Holds latest device states for the dashboard."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-cache","from":"flink","to":"cache","label":"state"}
{"t":"node","id":"tsdb","product":"lindorm","label":"Time-series store","group":"vpc","why":"Stores historical telemetry at scale for analysis."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-tsdb","from":"flink","to":"tsdb","label":"write"}
{"t":"node","id":"dashboard","product":"datav","label":"Live dashboard","group":"sg","why":"Visualizes telemetry and anomalies in real time."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dashboard-cache","from":"dashboard","to":"cache","label":"read"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dashboard-tsdb","from":"dashboard","to":"tsdb","label":"query"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Alert logs","group":"sg","why":"Persists anomaly alerts for auditing and review."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-logs","from":"flink","to":"logs","label":"alerts","kind":"async"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Real-time IoT pipeline: MQTT ingestion, Kafka buffering, Flink anomaly detection, Tair live cache, Lindorm storage and DataV dashboard."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a RAG assistant architecture: employees reach an API gateway, AgentCore orchestrates Qwen via Model Studio, and Milvus stores policy embeddings."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","agentcore","model-studio","milvus","oss","ecs"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internal users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Staff asking questions about policies and wiki content."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Assistant VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes internal HTTPS traffic to the API gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Authenticates employees and throttles requests to the agent."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"agent","product":"agentcore","label":"AgentCore","group":"vpc","why":"Orchestrates RAG: retrieves context then calls Qwen to answer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-agent","from":"gateway","to":"agent"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Hosts Qwen models that generate answers from retrieved context."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-llm","from":"agent","to":"llm","label":"Qwen API"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores embeddings of policy docs and wiki for semantic search."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-vector","from":"agent","to":"vector","label":"search"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"OSS","group":"sg","why":"Holds raw policy PDFs and wiki exports for the ingestion pipeline."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-docs","from":"agent","to":"docs","label":"read docs"}
{"t":"node","id":"ingest","product":"ecs","label":"Ingestion worker","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Chunks documents, embeds them via Model Studio and writes to Milvus."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ingest-docs","from":"ingest","to":"docs","label":"fetch"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ingest-llm","from":"ingest","to":"llm","label":"embed"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ingest-vector","from":"ingest","to":"vector","label":"write"}
{"t":"done","summary":"RAG assistant using AgentCore, Model Studio Qwen, Milvus vector store and OSS document storage behind an ALB and API gateway."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a Kubernetes architecture with ACK, MSE for discovery, an API gateway, RocketMQ, Tair cache and PolarDB."}
{"t":"req","text":"Team uses Java for 20 microservices"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","ack","mse","rocketmq","tair","polardb","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Clients","group":"internet","why":"External callers reaching the platform."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves domain to the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Microservices VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Single entry point routing to services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the 20 Java microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ack","from":"gateway","to":"ack","label":"gRPC/HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"mse","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Service discovery and config for Java."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mse","from":"ack","to":"mse","label":"discovery","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Async messaging between microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mq","from":"ack","to":"mq","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Shared cache for hot data and sessions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database for all services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and tracing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"ACK cluster with Cloud-native API Gateway, MSE Nacos, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB for 20 Java microservices."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a highly available web shop in Singapore with ESA, ALB, ECS across two zones, Tair cache and RDS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers","group":"internet","why":"30,000 daily users browsing the store."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the store domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches pages and accelerates dynamic requests across Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Store VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Spreads traffic over both zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks injection attacks and bots before the app."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store application in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Adds servers automatically during big sales peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair and orders to RDS, both with a standby in the second zone."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Keeps carts and sessions fast across zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders with a zone standby for HA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product images that ESA serves from edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logs and alerts for troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Highly available online store in Singapore behind ESA, ALB with WAF, ECS with Auto Scaling, Tair and RDS."}

{"t":"say","text":"For 25 developers needing an agentic AI coding assistant with SSO and admin controls, Qoder Teams is the right fit."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Agentic coding assistant for teams with SSO, admin controls and usage analytics."}
{"t":"rec","product":"model-studio","fit":"complement","why":"Provides the Qwen models that power Qoder Teams agents."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Qoder Teams gives your 25 developers an agentic AI coding assistant with SSO and admin controls, powered by Model Studio."}

{"t":"say","text":"For 15 developers, Qoder Teams gives managed seats, SSO and admin controls for AI coding."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Managed seats with SSO, privacy mode and usage analytics for a 15-developer team."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Per-member API keys so the team can use Qwen models inside their existing IDEs."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommended Qoder Teams as the primary AI coding assistant for your 15 developers, complemented by Token Plan for IDE integration."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll connect your Singapore data center to Alibaba Cloud via Express Connect and set up a phased VM migration."}
{"t":"req","text":"On-premises data center in Singapore, private link to cloud"}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","cen","vpc","ecs","smc","cloud-backup","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"On-premises DC (Singapore)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"On-premises data center","group":"onprem","why":"Existing VMs and workloads to migrate step by step."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Cloud VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"express","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"vpc","why":"Private dedicated link between on-prem DC and VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-express","from":"dc","to":"express","label":"private link"}
{"t":"node","id":"ecs","product":"ecs","label":"Migrated VMs","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Target compute for VMs migrated from on-premises."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-express-ecs","from":"express","to":"ecs","label":"VPC traffic"}
{"t":"node","id":"smc","product":"smc","label":"Server Migration Center","group":"sg","why":"Incremental VM migration from on-prem to ECS."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-smc-ecs","from":"smc","to":"ecs","kind":"control","label":"migrate"}
{"t":"node","id":"backup","product":"cloud-backup","label":"Cloud Backup","group":"sg","why":"Protects migrated VMs during transition."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ecs-backup","from":"ecs","to":"backup","kind":"control","label":"backup"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"sg","why":"Centralized monitoring for migration progress."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ecs-logs","from":"ecs","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"logs"}
{"t":"rec","product":"cen","fit":"complement","why":"Add CEN later if you need multi-region or multi-VPC connectivity."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Express Connect links your Singapore DC to a VPC; SMC handles phased VM migration to ECS with backup and logging."}

{"t":"say","text":"For a company-wide assistant that creates docs, slides and research for non-developers, QwenWork is the ready-made choice."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"primary","why":"All-in-one workplace agent producing documents, slides, sheets and web pages for every department."}
{"t":"rec","product":"dingtalk","fit":"complement","why":"Enterprise messaging where staff can chat with QwenWork directly in daily conversations."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommend QwenWork as the primary company-wide AI assistant, complemented by DingTalk for chat access."}

{"t":"say","text":"For a team AI agent, Qoder Teams gives developers seats and admin controls, while QwenWork serves the whole company. Which audience fits?"}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Team coding agent with SSO, privacy mode, admin dashboard and usage analytics for engineering teams."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"complement","why":"All-in-one workplace agent for docs, slides and web pages when non-developers also need AI assistance."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommended Qoder Teams as the primary team AI agent, with QwenWork as a complement for broader company use."}

{"t":"say","text":"For 20 engineers using Qwen models inside Claude Code and Cursor, Token Plan gives per-member keys at a predictable monthly cost."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"primary","why":"Per-seat subscription with team keys for interactive coding tools like Cursor and Claude Code."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Token Plan provides 20 seats with per-member keys for Qwen models inside your existing coding tools at a fixed monthly cost."}

